strings.OFN_CAR_operation_african_freedom_desc:
It was the duty of the American soldiers in Africa to safeguard freedom and democracy, and that hasn't changed. The C.A.R. might have been a total disaster, but our troops can salvage the situation. By securing territories, we will be able to form and strengthen allied regimes along the way. This operation might not be a complete success, but we will continue to fight for the liberation of Africa.

